      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To note: Mac support in the iOS build is on staff's radar, per one of the developers. However, a blocking issue in Unity with iOS applications on Apple Silicon Macs and how it detects the platform prevents them from running it without crashing or weird bugs.\n\nWhilst they do purportedly have ideas in mind on ways they *could* fix this, that would require some level of work in supporting macOS, which they are not ready to do, even in an unofficial capacity, at the time I spoke with them. So barring Unity themselves fixing this issue, there won't be Mac support, even for the iOS build, at this time.\n\nDefinitely leave your support and feedback though! It helps them know if this is worth pursuing down the road!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
