      "value": "@{623332824c44417bc9c5b8e0|full_name} we actually don't. SteamVR *was* on macOS, but only for eGPUs on Intel Macs. Apple Silicon was never properly supported, and it hasn't been updated in years. It never even supported the Quest. Steam Link was never added.\n\nValve treated it as a barebones project on Mac up until Apple Silicon was launched at which point Valve basically gave up.",
